OL,3,GNEWSA'Thousands' of jobs in NI are
OL,4,Acoming from defence contracts, says
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FA government minister has defended a
OL,8,Fcut in Northern Ireland's
OL,9,Finfrastructure budget to put more money
OL,10,Finto defence.
OL,12,FA spending reallocation in last week's
OL,13,FWestminster budget means the executive
OL,14,Fwill get #117m less than previously
OL,15,Fplanned over the next four years.
OL,17,FSarah Owen, the Northern Ireland Office
OL,18,Fminister, said "thousands" of jobs in
OL,19,FNI are coming from defence contracts.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
